      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.38,
          "en": "Now before we dig deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.38,
          "end": 5.01,
          "en": "into the composition API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.01,
          "end": 7.93,
          "en": "here is an optional lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.93,
          "end": 10.87,
          "en": "and I really want to emphasize this, it's optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.87,
          "end": 12.83,
          "en": "You can skip this lecture for now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.83,
          "end": 14.02,
          "en": "proceed with the rest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.02,
          "end": 15.683,
          "en": "and come back to it later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.58,
          "end": 20.06,
          "en": "I wanna explore this reactivity concept a bit more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.06,
          "end": 22.07,
          "en": "to make sure we're all on the same page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.07,
          "end": 25.28,
          "en": "and there are no unanswered questions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 26.8,
          "en": "I hope I could make it clear,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.8,
          "end": 28.6,
          "en": "how ref and reactive works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.6,
          "end": 30.08,
          "en": "that they're very similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.08,
          "end": 31.6,
          "en": "but that I could also make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.6,
          "end": 33.38,
          "en": "what the difference is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.38,
          "end": 35.62,
          "en": "I locked both to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 35.62,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "and I'll do it again here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "with the age here as an example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 43.21,
          "en": "so that we can again see the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.21,
          "end": 44.86,
          "en": "So I'm logging uAge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 44.86,
          "end": 45.92,
          "en": "which is a ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 45.92,
          "end": 48.28,
          "en": "and user which is a reactive object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.77,
          "end": 53.94,
          "en": "and I need to import ref again for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 54.92,
          "end": 55.79,
          "en": "and if I do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.79,
          "end": 57.01,
          "en": "if I save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.11,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.84,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "here our log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 62.32,
          "en": "The first one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 62.32,
          "end": 63.66,
          "en": "that is our ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 63.66,
          "end": 65.97,
          "en": "you'll see it's an object with the value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 65.97,
          "end": 67.22,
          "en": "and in that value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 67.22,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "the number is stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 71.88,
          "en": "and we have the getters and setters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 71.88,
          "end": 73.71000000000001,
          "en": "The object, the reactive object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 73.71000000000001,
          "end": 76.5,
          "en": "is a proxy wrapped around our object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 76.5,
          "end": 78.57,
          "en": "and it has those extra handlers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 78.57,
          "end": 80.95,
          "en": "for dealing with data changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 80.95,
          "end": 82.60300000000001,
          "en": "so that vue is aware of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 86.7,
          "en": "Now a common mistake",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 86.7,
          "end": 89.88,
          "en": "or something which can be hard to understand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "is that these objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 93.91,
          "en": "the ref object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 93.91,
          "end": 97.2,
          "en": "and the reactive object are reactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 99.86,
          "en": "but not the values stored in them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 99.86,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "which is why we have to pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "the entire user object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 107.17,
          "en": "and not the name and age separated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 107.17,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "Just to make this clear again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "if I would pass user, name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.21000000000001,
          "en": "and age like this to the template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 116.68,
          "en": "so if I drill into the user object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 116.68,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "and I provide that on a name and age key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 121.22,
          "en": "if we do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 121.22,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "and then try outputting name and age here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 124.23,
          "end": 126.08,
          "en": "that would work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 126.08,
          "end": 127.61,
          "en": "as you can tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 127.61,
          "end": 129.01,
          "en": "but after two seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 129.01,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "it wouldn't update.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 133.9,
          "en": "It always stays at Maximilian 31",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 133.9,
          "end": 136.32999999999998,
          "en": "and those changes made here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 136.32999999999998,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "aren't picked up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 138.31,
          "end": 139.39,
          "en": "and the reason for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 139.39,
          "end": 141.82999999999998,
          "en": "is that the entire object is reactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 141.82999999999998,
          "end": 144.7,
          "en": "but the values in those properties are not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 144.7,
          "end": 147.74,
          "en": "and if we expose those values to the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 147.74,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "vue thinks that only the values matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 151.89,
          "en": "and not the entire object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 151.89,
          "end": 155.17000000000002,
          "en": "hence it's just interested in changes to those values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 155.17000000000002,
          "end": 158.46,
          "en": "and since those values are not reactive objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 159.89,
          "en": "and not refs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 159.89,
          "end": 162.31,
          "en": "it will never know about these changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 162.31,
          "end": 165.35,
          "en": "That's why we had to do it differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 165.35,
          "end": 169.34,
          "en": "hence I'm reversing this to go back to the old code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 169.34,
          "end": 171.24,
          "en": "where I expose the entire user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 171.24,
          "end": 172.8,
          "en": "and access it in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 174.56,
          "end": 177.44,
          "en": "but now back to this console log statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 177.44,
          "end": 180.12,
          "en": "Here we can basically see the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 180.12,
          "end": 184.39,
          "en": "If I console log uAge.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 184.39,
          "end": 186.95,
          "en": "and I also console log user.name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 186.95,
          "end": 188.273,
          "en": "and user.age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 189.68,
          "end": 192.64,
          "en": "If I log these three things here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 192.64,
          "end": 193.69,
          "en": "if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 193.69,
          "end": 195.75,
          "en": "you see 31 Maximilian",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 195.75,
          "end": 198.18,
          "en": "and 31 here in the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 198.18,
          "end": 201.94,
          "en": "and these are ordinary JavaScript values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 201.94,
          "end": 203.81,
          "en": "These are not special objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 203.81,
          "end": 208.22,
          "en": "hence they have no watch mechanism attached to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 208.22,
          "end": 211.28,
          "en": "This is what would arrive in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 211.28,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "if we just return user.name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 216.86,
          "en": "or user.age in this object down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 216.86,
          "end": 218.15,
          "en": "what I did a second ago",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 219.32,
          "end": 221.63,
          "en": "and then it hopefully is clear that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 221.63,
          "end": 223.52,
          "en": "this will never change to vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 223.52,
          "end": 224.61,
          "en": "It's just a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 224.61,
          "end": 225.44299999999998,
          "en": "just a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 225.44299999999998,
          "end": 226.76,
          "en": "It never changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 226.76,
          "end": 229.87,
          "en": "Yes the object from which I extracted those values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 229.87,
          "end": 231.73,
          "en": "that object changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 231.73,
          "end": 234.37,
          "en": "but I took a snapshot of those values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 234.37,
          "end": 235.81,
          "en": "before the change happened,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 235.81,
          "end": 237.63,
          "en": "that's basically what I'm doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 237.63,
          "end": 238.883,
          "en": "and that's the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 240.44,
          "end": 242.74,
          "en": "Now vue has helper methods here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 242.74,
          "end": 244.58,
          "en": "which can help us with understanding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 244.58,
          "end": 246.4,
          "en": "what's reactive and not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 246.4,
          "end": 248.17,
          "en": "It has isReactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 248.17,
          "end": 250.54,
          "en": "and that is ref function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 250.54,
          "end": 252.6,
          "en": "and whenever something is reactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 253.67,
          "en": "or is a ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 253.67,
          "end": 255.69,
          "en": "when you expose it to the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 255.69,
          "end": 257.36,
          "en": "updates will be picked up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 257.36,
          "end": 258.89,
          "en": "Whenever that's not the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 258.89,
          "end": 260.93,
          "en": "updates will not be picked up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 260.93,
          "end": 264.92,
          "en": "So here we can check if uAge.value is a ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 264.92,
          "end": 268.96,
          "en": "and we can check if username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 268.96,
          "end": 271.99,
          "en": "user.name I mean is reactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 271.99,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "and if I do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 275.46,
          "en": "save this and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 277.2,
          "en": "I get false twice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 278.04,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "and that's just what I've been talking about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 281.623,
          "en": "over the last minutes or so.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 282.81,
          "end": 283.64300000000003,
          "en": "On the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 283.64300000000003,
          "end": 285.48,
          "en": "if I check the entire uAge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 285.48,
          "end": 287.283,
          "en": "and the entire user object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 288.17,
          "end": 291.4,
          "en": "instead of the nested properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 291.4,
          "end": 293.47,
          "en": "I get true twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 293.47,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "So whenever we expose the entire ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 296.08,
          "end": 298.03,
          "en": "or the entire reactive object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 298.03,
          "end": 300.1,
          "en": "to the template by returning it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 300.1,
          "end": 301.8,
          "en": "changes will be picked up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 303.48,
          "en": "and reflected in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 303.48,
          "end": 304.953,
          "en": "It's as easy as that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 306.69,
          "end": 309.15,
          "en": "Now I'll remove this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 309.15,
          "end": 311.93,
          "en": "but it can be helpful to be aware of these helper methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 311.93,
          "end": 313.294,
          "en": "in case you wanna find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 313.294,
          "end": 315.263,
          "en": "whether something is reactive or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 317.32,
          "end": 319.85,
          "en": "Now there actually also would be a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 319.85,
          "end": 322.86,
          "en": "of making the nested values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
